.SH "H5I BOX COMPARE"
Compare environments side by side. Changes + latest run results (the "arena" reviewer comparison). Best on envs sharing one base
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SS SYNOPSIS
\fBcompare\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAMES\fR> 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SS OPTIONS
