\fB\-\-force\fR
Replace a non\-empty output directory
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the export summary as JSON instead of the human view
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>

.SH "H5I BOX PROPOSE"
Snapshot the worktree (mediated commit, path-allowlist enforced) and mark the box proposed. Produces a review brief. Never writes the parent branch. `export` runs this as its freeze step
