.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH "H5I BOX CACHE LIST"
List the caches on this clone
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SS SYNOPSIS
\fBlist\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SS OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH "H5I BOX CACHE MOUNTS"
Show which caches a box created right now would be given, and where they would appear inside it
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SS SYNOPSIS
\fBmounts\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
