\fB\-\-json\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH "H5I BOX CACHE REFRESH"
Populate a cache by fetching this project's dependencies
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SS SYNOPSIS
\fBrefresh\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIECO\fR> 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
