\fBtype\fR [\fB\-s\fR|\fB\-\-session\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITARGET\fR> <\fITEXT\fR> 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SS OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-session\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Which session, when more than one is open
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fITARGET\fR>
`@e3` from a `snapshot`, or a CSS selector
.TP
<\fITEXT\fR>
The text
