\fBexport\fR [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-project\fR] [\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SS OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-project\fR \fI<NAME>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR \fI<N>\fR
A version number, or the working draft when omitted
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: html]
`html` or `pdf`. PDF needs a local Chromium
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Where to write it. Defaults beside the report
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
